CT,25,T
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F496A1772483663
OL,1,  V<,,4<,,4<,,4Spp0pp0p``0pp0      G4/22
OL,2,T]V5b(55b(55j5Sj5.%jj5/l4
OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, Foreign Secretary Sir Geoffrey Howe
OL,6, has described Salman Rushdie's book,
OL,7, The Satanic Verses, as "offensive".
OL,9,FIn an implicitly conciliatory gesture
OL,10,Ftowards Iran, he said he understood why
OL,11,Fthe book had been criticised and said
OL,12,FBritain did not agree with its views.
OL,14,FBut Sir Geoffrey stressed that Britain
OL,15,Fcould not allow the principle of
OL,16,Ffreedom of speech to be overturned.
OL,18,FEarlier, Britain rejected an offer of
OL,19,Ftalks from Iran on the affair, saying
OL,20,FIran's threats of violence against
OL,21,FMr Rushdie must be lifted first.
OL,23,T]CFrom 02-03-89 / teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
FL,497,190,120,250,0,100
PN,49605
SC,0005
CT,25,T
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F496A1772483663
OL,1,  V<,,4<,,4<,,4Spp0pp0p``0pp0      G5/22
OL,2,T]V5b(55b(55j5Sj5.%jj5/l4
OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, EC environment ministers in Brussels
OL,6, have agreed on the total elimination of
OL,7, chemicals which harm the ozone layer.
OL,9,FA 50 per cent cut in chlorofluoro-
OL,10,Fcarbons (CFCs) by 1998 had already
OL,11,Fbeen agreed and ministers were expected
OL,12,Fto extend this to an 85 per cent cut.
OL,13,F
OL,14,FBut the EC ministers instead agreed in
OL,15,Fprincipal on a total ban on CFCs by the
OL,16,Fyear 2000 and an 85 per cent cut as
OL,17,Fsoon as possible.
OL,18,F
OL,19,FBritain's environment minister, Lord
OL,20,FCaithness, said it was very exciting
OL,21,Fprogress and a substantial advance.
OL,22,F
OL,23,T]CFrom 02-03-89 / teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
FL,497,190,120,250,0,100
PN,49606
SC,0006
CT,25,T
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F496A1772483663
OL,1,  V<,,4<,,4<,,4Spp0pp0p``0pp0      G6/22
OL,2,T]V5b(55b(55j5Sj5.%jj5/l4 BACKGROUND
OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##! ##########
OL,5, Environment Minister Lord Caithness has
OL,6, welcomed the EC's call for the total
OL,7, elimination of CFCs.
OL,9,FBut he stressed that the EC could
OL,10,Fnot save the ozone layer on its own.
OL,11,FTalks would be needed to persuade other
OL,12,Fmajor producers to co-operate, he said.
OL,13,F
OL,14,FHe emphasised the importance of the
OL,15,Finternational conference to be held in
OL,16,FLondon by the Government this weekend.
OL,18,FHe also said the EC should move against
OL,19,FCFCs not covered by a protocol drawn up
OL,20,Fin Montreal last year and also against
OL,21,Fhalons, used in firefighting equipment.
OL,23,T]CFrom 02-03-89 / teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
FL,497,190,120,250,0,100
PN,49607
SC,0007
CT,25,T
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F496A1772483663
OL,1,  V<,,4<,,4<,,4Spp0pp0p``0pp0      G7/22
OL,2,T]V5b(55b(55j5Sj5.%jj5/l4
OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, President Botha of South Africa has
OL,6, said he will return to office in about
OL,7, a month's time.
OL,9,FMr Botha, 73, who recently had a slight
OL,10,Fstroke, made the announcement after a
OL,11,Fshort visit to his office in Cape Town.
OL,13,FHe said he would attend to matters of
OL,14,Fstate as well as possible election
OL,15,Fdates on his return.
OL,17,FEarlier today, the ruling National
OL,18,FParty's new leader Mr FW de Klerk
OL,19,Fcalled for a new peace initiative with
OL,20,Fblack leaders and said that things
OL,21,Fwould have to change drastically.
OL,23,T]CFrom 02-03-89 / teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
FL,497,190,120,250,0,100
PN,49608
