CT,25,T
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F496A1772483663
OL,1,  V<,,4<,,4<,,4Spp0pp0p``0pp0      G8/22
OL,2,T]V5b(55b(55j5Sj5.%jj5/l4
OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, French police say they have found the
OL,6, body of one of the three British
OL,7, climbers missing in the Alps.
OL,9,FThey say the body was found on the
OL,10,FItalian side of the Mont Blanc range.
OL,12,FThe search for the two other missing
OL,13,FBritons and a West German will be
OL,14,Fresumed tomorrow.
OL,16,FThe British climbers are from Bristol
OL,17,Fand Wiltshire. The party went missing
OL,18,Fa week ago.
OL,19,F
OL,20,F
OL,21,F
OL,23,T]CFrom 02-03-89 / teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
FL,497,190,120,250,0,100
PN,49609
SC,0009
CT,25,T
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F496A1772483663
OL,1,  V<,,4<,,4<,,4Spp0pp0p``0pp0      G9/22
OL,2,T]V5b(55b(55j5Sj5.%jj5/l4
OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, English Heritage has agreed to close
OL,6, Stonehenge for 24 hours during the
OL,7, Summer Solstice in June this year.
OL,9,FThe move is designed to stop the annual
OL,10,Fskirmish between hippies and druids
OL,11,Fwanting to hold a festival at the site
OL,12,Fand police determined to keep them out.
OL,14,FThe organisation said it was taking the
OL,15,Faction reluctantly on the advice of
OL,16,FWiltshire police. Last year there were
OL,17,F67 arrests on the day.
OL,19,FSelf-styled arch druid Mr Rollo
OL,20,FMaughfling said it was "like closing
OL,21,FWestminster Abbey at Christmas".
OL,23,T]CFrom 02-03-89 / teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
