CT,25,T
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F496A1772483663
OL,1,  V<,,4<,,4<,,4Spp0pp0p``0pp0     G11/22
OL,2,T]V5b(55b(55j5Sj5.%jj5/l4 BACKGROUND
OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##! ##########
OL,5, The Commons defence committee has said
OL,6, the Gurkhas should continue to be part
OL,7, of the British Army.
OL,9,FThe famous Nepalese fighters face an
OL,10,Funcertain future after Britain leaves
OL,11,FHong Kong, where three of their five
OL,12,Fbatallions are based.
OL,14,FBut the MPs say there would be no
OL,15,Fdifficulty in adapting Gurkha
OL,16,Finfantry troops to other roles.
OL,18,FThey suggest that the soldiers could
OL,19,Feven be redeployed in special forces
OL,20,Fsuch as the SAS and the Special Boat
OL,21,FSquadron.
OL,23,T]CFrom 02-03-89 / teletextarchive.com
